Third-party reference acknowledgement:

The virtual desktop COM interface signatures (IIDs, vtable ordering) were
derived from the publicly available reverse-engineering work of:

  - MScholtes/VirtualDesktop (MIT, Copyright (c) 2017 Markus Scholtes)
  - saimanish1/logitech-ipc-protocol (cross-validation)

This project is an independent implementation and does not copy code from
those projects; only the interface contract (GUIDs and method ordering) is
shared. Those projects are not affiliated with this one.
